      "id": "ljyu-jh-en-01",
      "grade": 7,
      "questionType": "single_choice",
      "text": "—How ___ is the red sweater? —It's 80 yuan.",
      "options": {
        "A": "many",
        "B": "much",
        "C": "long",
        "D": "old"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "analysis": "询问价格用 how much；how many 问数量，how long 问长度或时间。",
      "knowledgePoints": [
        "疑问词"
      ],
      "difficultyStars": 2,
      "source": "ljyu13 原创"
    },
    {
      "id": "ljyu-jh-en-02",
      "grade": 7,
      "questionType": "fill_blank",
      "text": "There ___ some books on the desk.",
      "answer": "are",
      "analysis": "books 是可数名词复数，there be 句型中用 are。",
      "knowledgePoints": [
        "there be句型"
      ],
      "difficultyStars": 2,
      "source": "ljyu13 原创"
    },
    {
      "id": "ljyu-jh-en-03",
      "grade": 8,
      "questionType": "single_choice",
      "text": "He ___ to school by bike every day.",
      "options": {
        "A": "goes",
        "B": "go",
        "C": "going",
        "D": "went"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "analysis": "主语 He 为第三人称单数，一般现在时动词要加 -s，用 goes。",
      "knowledgePoints": [
        "一般现在时"
      ],
      "difficultyStars": 2,
      "source": "ljyu13 原创"
    },
    {
      "id": "ljyu-jh-en-04",
      "grade": 8,
      "questionType": "true_false",
      "text": "形容词比较级前可以用 much 修饰，表示“……得多”。",
      "answer": "正确",
      "analysis": "much 可以修饰比较级加强程度，如 much better 表示“好得多”。",
      "knowledgePoints": [
        "比较级"
      ],
      "difficultyStars": 2,
      "source": "ljyu13 原创"
    },
    {
      "id": "ljyu-jh-en-05",
      "grade": 9,
      "questionType": "single_choice",
      "text": "The book ___ I bought yesterday is very interesting.",
      "options": {
        "A": "who",
        "B": "whom",
        "C": "that",
        "D": "what"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "analysis": "先行词 the book 指物，定语从句中作 bought 的宾语，可用 that 或 which。",
      "knowledgePoints": [
        "定语从句"
      ],
      "difficultyStars": 3,
      "source": "ljyu13 原创"
    },
    {
      "id": "ljyu-jh-en-06",
      "grade": 9,
      "questionType": "fill_blank",
      "text": "If it ___ (rain) tomorrow, we will stay at home.",
      "answer": "rains",
